// ARGS: 2
// STDIN: 1 99 3
// EXPECT: a window of 2 readings
// EXPECT:   +1    n=1 mean=1.00 min=1 max=1
// EXPECT:   +99   n=2 mean=50.00 min=1 max=99
// EXPECT:     (dropped 1)
// EXPECT:   +3    n=2 mean=51.00 min=3 max=99
// EXPECT: pushed 3, holding 2, dropped 1
// EXPECT: first reading above 50: number 1 of the window (99)
// EXPECT: fnv1a("vole"): C 7bbe116d, vole 7bbe116d
